    "sentence_translations": [
      "Our Times Are Different",
      "",
      "I have a friend. Her time and my time are very different.",
      "",
      "Once, we agreed to have a meal together. We agreed to meet at the restaurant at 12 noon.",
      "I arrived at 11:50. After I had waited for thirty minutes, I asked her where she was.",
      "She said that she was on her way, and would arrive in another ten minutes. Ten minutes later, she still hadn’t arrived.",
      "I asked her again where she was. She said she would arrive soon, in another five minutes.",
      "She told me to order first. When I’d finished ordering, she still hadn’t arrived. She finally arrived at 1 o’clock.",
      "",
      "Our times are very different.",
      ""
    ]
